# Live Lebur batch on Ethereum Sepolia, OPEN for orders until 2026-08-05T03:24:48Z.
# Deliberately the open one rather than the settled one: a settled batch is a
# read-only artefact, and this page is worth far more when you can actually seal
# an order against it, read your own order back, and clear the batch yourself.
#
# This deployment already ran and settled one auction (epoch 0) and was reopened
# for epoch 1 with startNewBatch — which is why its revealed values read zero
# until the next clearing. The SETTLED batch you can read directly is
# 0x6a022daacef56e7751828b17a3da3486950008b2; point NEXT_PUBLIC_BATCH at it (with
# its own two cTokens, see the README) to inspect a finished auction instead.
#
# Both run the contract as of this branch, against the same Curve pool and coins.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BATCH=0x5f4a77e5d14acb63f3d344dd186d1cd9c94c0ddd
NEXT_PUBLIC_CTOKEN0=0xc8b9721376cf230af9f4b0978ea561db571ae067
NEXT_PUBLIC_CTOKEN1=0x106251f45c79655f49997180323ce92af665de2a
NEXT_PUBLIC_TOKEN0=0x838204BC3D82B29E3697Bfe9A17662c57943e34F
NEXT_PUBLIC_TOKEN1=0x8A00F10b198f8cC9266d6E330b9792E395707CB7
NEXT_PUBLIC_POOL=0x29f2087bc6489e9FC9f35CA34132Fca9158de7A0
NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC=https://ethereum-sepolia-rpc.publicnode.com
